// Title: Use Short Name Path in Image
// ID: a96970af-f126-420d-90e1-d37bf25e50e1
// Status: test
// Level: medium
// Author: frack113, Nasreddine Bencherchali
// Date: 2022-08-07
// Tags: attack.stealth, attack.t1564.004
// Description: Detect use of the Windows 8.3 short name. Which could be used as a method to avoid Image detection
// Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

(((Image CONTAINS "~1\\" OR Image CONTAINS "~2\\")) AND NOT (((((Image CONTAINS "\\AppData\\" AND Image CONTAINS "\\Temp\\")) OR ((Image ENDSWITH "~1\\unzip.exe" OR Image ENDSWITH "~1\\7zG.exe"))) OR ((ParentImage EQ "C:\\Windows\\System32\\Dism.exe" OR ParentImage EQ "C:\\Windows\\System32\\cleanmgr.exe")))) AND NOT ((((Product EQ "InstallShield (R)") OR (Description EQ "InstallShield (R) Setup Engine") OR (Company EQ "InstallShield Software Corporation")) OR (ParentImage ENDSWITH "\\thor\\thor64.exe") OR (ParentImage ENDSWITH "\\WebEx\\WebexHost.exe"))))
